    test(); groups 2..K from the saved RNG state S0, the first group last (RUN_NOTES §0a);
  * held-out normals and the secondary objective exactly as the port (RNG-isolated).
Own ORACLE (collector): common epoch with the max 5-seed mean test AUROC of that group (first max; A15.1 finite in all
seeds). CPU with deterministic algorithms (port D8).
